        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 935AR, Modern Knob with Steeped Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Knob with Arched Rose is available in 7 beautiful finishes including polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. This Omnia made knobset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches that are 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick. The Omnia 935 Knob with Arched Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions, making it a great choice for doors throughout your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 935AR Modern Knob with Arched Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 935AR Modern Knob with Arched Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Knob with Arched Rose, Omnia 935AR",
                "description": "Omnia 935AR, Modern Knob with Arched Rose, - The Modern Knob with Arched Rose is available in 7 beautiful finishes including polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. This Omnia made knobset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches that are 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick. The Omnia 935 Knob with Arched Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions, making it a great choice for doors throughout your home.",
                "keywords": "Modern Knobset with Arched Rosettes, Omnia 935AR Modern Knob with Arched Rosette, Modern Knob with Arched Roses, OMN-935AR, omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, classic knobs, traditional knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, Omnia 935AR Solid Brass Modern Knobsets, Omnia 935 Knob with Arched Rosettes, Modern Knob with Steeped Arched Roses,"
